10.Write a script to calculate factorial of a number using for loop.
Answer:
#! /bin/bash
read -p "Enter a number: " n
fact=1
for ((i=1; i<=n; i++))
do
fact=$((fact * i))
done
echo "Factorial of $n is $fact"
